{"ts":"2026-07-10T10:32:51.727Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"append","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Source\nGitHub issue #490 (version 2026.7.9).\n\n## Reproduction\n```bash\npm log some-id \"a note\"\n# Error: Unknown command log\n# Next steps: Did you mean: extension catalog, package catalog?\n```\n\n## Problem\nThe suggester ranks by substring containment (\"log\" ⊂ \"cataLOG\"), so both catalog subcommands outrank the commands an agent actually means — `history`, `comments`, `notes`. An agent following the hint is misdirected to the extension catalog instead of the item-history surface.\n\n## Proposed ranking\n1. Alias/synonym table for the top verbs agents guess (log→history/comments/notes, ls→list, rm→delete, …)\n2. Edit distance on the command token\n3. Substring hits last\n\nEven a small hardcoded synonym table removes most misdirection. The rest of the unknown-command error contract (structured JSON, recovery bundle, exit 2) is good — only the ranking misleads.\n\n## Why it matters for agents\nStateless agents guess verbs constantly; suggestion quality determines whether recovery costs one retry or a full `pm --help` roundtrip (96 lines) plus re-orientation. Related: pm-gdi7 covers the unknown-OPTION flag-suggestion gap; this covers unknown-COMMAND ranking."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-10T10:32:51.727Z"}],"before_hash":"35e9ca69d2fa9c30e43f144db60345b7e92c3d7c0dacbcd5e2bfd156b10fb69e","after_hash":"3718ef99cfd767d8752ff97fe368e138d0ab6b339203f4789fe1bbd9e580cb66"}
{"ts":"2026-07-10T10:36:33.591Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-10T10:36:33.591Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm log suggests history/comments/notes ahead of catalog commands; suggester ranks synonym table then edit distance then substring; unit tests cover top-10 verb synonyms; unknown-command JSON contract shape unchanged"}],"before_hash":"3718ef99cfd767d8752ff97fe368e138d0ab6b339203f4789fe1bbd9e580cb66","after_hash":"1df5d4499f462c8714ff492e605d245fca962835bb0c30b04288517daa5f69a8"}
